    {
      "id": "5BXl-Tor6jUquichehA2M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 119.85806343485609,
      "y": 55420,
      "width": 1603.800048828125,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "c0H2VKAyhJ9mA3DvO5ahw",
        "Ut8_4tfgQxZ-mXIWQFoaZ",
        "--pTspSQMtk_VVy-wMRxh"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0qK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1065665034,
      "version": 232,
      "versionNonce": 275269348,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793705132900,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Distribution shift occurs when the statistical properties \n  of data at inference time differ from those in training data.\n  AI models are optimized for their training distribution — \n  when that distribution shifts, performance degrades, often \n  silently and catastrophically.\n° Types: covariate shift (input features change), \n  label shift (output proportions change), \n  concept drift (the relationship between inputs and outputs changes over time). \n° Distribution shift is the most common cause of production AI failures \n  and a core safety concern for deployed systems.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Distribution shift occurs when the statistical properties \n  of data at inference time differ from those in training data.\n  AI models are optimized for their training distribution — \n  when that distribution shifts, performance degrades, often \n  silently and catastrophically.\n° Types: covariate shift (input features change), \n  label shift (output proportions change), \n  concept drift (the relationship between inputs and outputs changes over time). \n° Distribution shift is the most common cause of production AI failures \n  and a core safety concern for deployed systems.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793608232299,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
