      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> How to create these Groups : \n\n        ° You select a Feature to separate the 2 Groups\n\n        ° You know the Value of that Feature to distinguish between the 2 Groups\n\n        ° You know the Output ( Outcome ) Value that makes a Group Privileged or Unprivileged",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> How to create these Groups : \n\n        ° You select a Feature to separate the 2 Groups\n\n        ° You know the Value of that Feature to distinguish between the 2 Groups\n\n        ° You know the Output ( Outcome ) Value that makes a Group Privileged or Unprivileged",
