      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> We need to monitor that they remain fair over real-world inference data as well\n\n   To do this, we  can schedule some metric requests,  such as to compute at \n \n   recurring intervals throughout deployment. \n\n   To do this, we simply pass the same payloads to the  /metrics/group/fairness/spd/request  endpoint:",
